    <model-tier-reason>Row A42 is credential-logic + cross-worktree consumption (task 130 C# `CreateFic` vs master PS `-FicOnly` estate) with auth blast-radius = every future customer's authentication. Explicit remediation plan §8 cost posture: "Fable/Opus for the two credential-logic rows is deliberate — the blast radius is every future customer's authentication." Sonnet-5's literal-execution posture is unsafe here: the reconciliation demands architectural judgment (path (a) subprocess delegation vs path (b) parity dual-path), and the cross-tenant refusal port (`Assert-SpaarkeFicTenancy`) requires reading master PS + C# side-by-side to preserve semantic equivalence — not a mechanical delta apply.</model-tier-reason>
